## Design System Files
- `frontend/docs/BRAND_GUIDELINES.md`: Complete branding specifications, color codes, typography scale, UI components, and copywriting rules.
- `frontend/shared/css/healpath-theme.css`: Ready-to-use CSS tokens and UI components.
